  "question": {
    "text": "Two cards are drawn successively with replacement from a well-shuffled deck of <math><mn>52</mn></math> cards. Let <math><mi>X</mi></math> denote the random variable of number of aces obtained in the two drawn cards. Then <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> equals:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>169</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>52</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>169</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>49</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>169</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>169</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Using the concept of complementary events,<br /><br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>52</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>52</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>144</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>169</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>169</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
